    "text": "kptv.com\nwebsite\nVancouver\nVancouver Lake under toxic algae advisory\nBy FOX 12 Staff,\n2 hours agoVANCOUVER, Wash. (KPTV) - Vancouver Lake is once again under a danger advisory because of harmful algae. On Wednesday, Clark County Public Health issued the warning for Vancouver Lake because of elevated levels of cyanotoxins. They say harmful algae blooms are present at several public access points to the lake,...",
